<title>USA: Vincam Group signs definitive merger pact.</title>
<headline>Vincam Group signs definitive merger pact.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vincam Group Inc said Thursday it entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Staff Administrators Inc, a privately-held professional employer organization based in Denver.</p>
<p>Vincam said it will issue 520,000 shares of its common stock in exchange for all of the equity in Staff Administrators and its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>The transaction is to be accounted for as a pooling of interests and is expected to close in January 1997.</p>
</text>
